WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:06.570
Your agent can build an entire product now. But does any of it actually work? That's the part pragma handles.

00:08.145 --> 00:10.535
You make two calls: the spec, and the plan.

00:12.245 --> 00:17.770
Then the agent takes over. Tests first. Eleven gates. No pull request until they pass.

00:18.945 --> 00:21.975
And if it gets stuck? It can't lower the bar to sneak through.

00:24.350 --> 00:28.640
Pragma. Open source, and built for iOS teams shipping with agents.
